          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. What are the x-coordinate and y-coordinate of the point of intersection of the two axes?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.212,
            0.886,
            0.275
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Point W has x-coordinate equal to – 5. Can you predict the coordinates of point H which is on the line through W parallel to the y-axis? Which quadrants can H lie in?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.28,
            0.887,
            0.322
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. Consider the points R (3, 0), A (0, – 2), M (– 5, – 2) and P (– 5, 2). If they are joined in the same order, predict:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.193,
            0.325,
            0.849,
            0.346
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) Two sides of RAMP that are perpendicular to each other."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.186,
            0.35,
            0.799,
            0.372
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) One side of RAMP that is parallel to one of the axes."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.181,
            0.374,
            0.884,
            0.416
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iii) Two points that are mirror images of each other in one axis. Which axis will this be?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.227,
            0.421,
            0.755,
            0.444
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Now plot the points and verify your predictions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.447,
            0.885,
            0.49
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. Plot point Z (5, – 6) on the Cartesian plane. Construct a right-angled triangle IZN and find the lengths of the three sides."
